    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Team_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Team Feats\">Team Feats</a></i></p><p>You and your allies are just as comfortable in the vehicle pool as on the battlefield and are capable of maintaining heavy equipment.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +3 competence bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> checks. At the time you make a check, for each ally within 12 squares of you who also has this Feat, the competence bonus increases by +1 (to a maximum of +7).</p><p>Additionally, when you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> Action to assist an ally who has this Feat with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check, you provide a bonus of +4 instead of +2.</p>",
